{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>I am Pharaoh.</b> That I have the power in my hand to issue a decree over my kingdom, and I decree that no man shall lift his hand without you — that is, not without your permission. Another interpretation: 'I am Pharaoh' — I shall be king, and without you, etc. And this is the meaning of 'but the throne' [alone]." "<b>His hand and his foot.</b> As its Targum renders."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:02.082049412Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}